   "source": [
    "# Kazakh Profanity Detection — Colab notebook\n",
    "**Baigazy Iliyas · ID 25MD0217 · DSSC5113 Bonus Project**\n",
    "\n",
    "Runs in a fresh Google Colab runtime (CPU is enough):\n",
    "1. clone the repository and install the pinned packages;\n",
    "2. load the **saved** model and predict on your own comment (no retraining);\n",
    "3. optionally rebuild the dataset, retrain and re-evaluate from scratch."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "ed4c6f15",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Get the code"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "b7969b1a",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "REPO_URL = \"https://github.com/baigazyev/kazakh-profanity-detection.git\"   
    "!git clone -q {REPO_URL} kazakh-profanity-detection\n",
    "%cd kazakh-profanity-detection\n",
    "!pip -q install -r requirements.txt"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "dea1520f",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "If `pip` changed a package that was already imported, use **Runtime → Restart session** once, then run the cell below (it changes into the repository folder again)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "27b1732e",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import os, sys, json\n",
    "if os.path.basename(os.getcwd()) != \"kazakh-profanity-detection\":\n",
    "    os.chdir(\"/content/kazakh-profanity-detection\")\n",
    "sys.path.insert(0, \"src\")\n",
    "import sklearn; print(\"scikit-learn\", sklearn.__version__)  
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "0bfdfed0",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Predict with the saved model"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "d25308c7",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "from src.predict import load, predict\n",
    "model, threshold = load()\n",
    "print(\"threshold =\", threshold)\n",
    "examples = [\"Сапасы ұнамады, кеңес бермеймін.\",\n",
    "            \"Есік өте керемет, бесік арбасы ыңғайлы\",\n",
    "            \"Мал ойын тартпаңдар\",\n",
    "            \"Шешеңнің амы, тартылмайды\",\n",
    "            \"Qotagimdi je\"]\n",
    "for r in predict(examples, model, threshold):\n",
    "    print(r[\"label\"], f'{r[\"prob_profanity\"]:.3f}', \"|\", r[\"text\"])"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "95211032",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Try your own comment"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "176c539a",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "text = input(\"Kazakh comment: \")\n",
    "r = predict(text, model, threshold)[0]\n",
    "print(\"label:\", r[\"label\"], \"(1 = Kazakh profanity, 0 = none)\", \"| P(profanity) =\", r[\"prob_profanity\"])"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "ba972537",
   "metadata": {},
